<!-- PBX3 grandstream.Common — GRP2602P mule (1.0.7.3). Provision + NTP.
     NAT mode is Account P52=Auto (Extension) — no global STUN (P76) in stream.
     P192 = Firmware Server Path (omit — do not point at provision).
     P237 = Config Server Path; P212 = Config Upgrade Via (2=HTTPS); P194 = Automatic Upgrade.
     Chatbot hygiene: no :// in P48; root is gs_provision (see Extension).
     P-tag order is cosmetic — phone keys by P-code; P2 listed first for readability. -->
    <P2>$padminpass</P2>
    <P1119>30</P1119>
    <P212>2</P212>
    <P237>$provpath</P237>
    <P194>0</P194>
    <P31>pool.ntp.org</P31>
    <P64>GMT</P64>
